subject: feat(messages): Error Inbox P2 — server-side error aggregation + triage

- requestDetailsRepo.getErrorSummary: SQL window-function GROUP BY over the
  FULL filtered set with coarse Sentry-style fingerprint provider|model|
  errorCategory (status='error' forced via indexed column), counts/cost/
  first+last seen/sample error + latest detailId for drill-in; exported
  errorFingerprint() helper
- /api/messages?view=errors: mirrors view=conversations shape, facets scoped
  to status=error, skips unused flat-list fetch
- InboxView: 4 triage columns (Open/Acknowledged/Resolved/Dismissed), category
  pills mirroring errorCategorizer taxonomy, sample error display-only,
  Analyze reuses /api/analyze-error flow, View opens shared detail drawer
- Triage persisted via settings KV boardColumns (MAP_REPLACE_KEYS, client owns
  full map, survives reload) — inboxIssues table deferred per design doc
- +17 vitest tests (grouping/cost/order/filters/empty/paging/settings
  round-trip); regressions green (53 in 5 related suites)
- design: research/9router/25-error-inbox-p2-design.md; BoardView untouched


